		(descr "onsemi NTMD4820N: DUAL N-channel power MOSFET, SOIC-8. VDSS 30 V, ID 8 A per channel, RDS(on) 20 mOhm max at VGS=10 V, VGS(max) +/-20 V. Two electrically independent FETs (G1/S1/D1 and G2/S2/D2) in one package; standard dual SO-8 MOSFET pinout. Used in AQROOT as ONE back-to-back reverse-isolation stage; two packages give two independent failure domains (D-068 / P2).")
